error[E0302]: operator 'gt' needs an ordered field, but field "active" of Article is 'bool'
  --> where_ops_order_refused.bit:17:39
   |
17 |   let a: Where<Article> = { active: { gt: true } }
   |                                       ^^ 'gt' works on numbers, decimals, strings and std/time types; bool, enum and []byte fields take eq, ne and in
